  "description": "High-performance PDF text find/replace library for .NET. Operates directly on PDF content streams — no DOCX conversion, no format loss. Zero external dependencies.\n\nThe netstandard2.0 build acts as a bridge DLL, compatible with .NET Framework 4.6.1+, .NET Core 2.0+, and .NET 5/6/7/8+. The net8.0 build is optimized for modern .NET. Install the package and reference the appropriate target — NuGet resolves automatically.\n\nMade in USA.",
